                                "sense_id": "6a432fe4-b308-3d89-a3ca-ea11ac6a1af1",
                                "text": "His paws rested on a sunken branch. The water moved down, clouded with the mud-stirrings of the leat. He lay so still that the trout returned to their stances beside the stone sterlings."
                            }
                        ]
